      verify: _enum(["none", "check"]).default("none").describe("What must pass before an updated branch is pushed. `none` (default) because the deterministic tier only ever produces a merge git itself resolved or an artifact a generator rebuilt, and running the project's whole gate once per PR is not affordable across a 50-PR run — CI on the PR is the real gate. `check` runs the `verbs.check` list (via `resolveVerb`) anyway, for a project where a bad push is expensive — trust-gated like every other project-sourced verb list ([[D-V2XJ-verb-cascade-and-repo-trust]]): needs `sdlc repo trust` or `sdlc pr update --trust`.")
